# Ground pcb: the motherboard's solder mask seen as a whole, a deep dark teal-green, satin, with faint lighter copper-pour patches a few metres across and a few paler flecks. The ground shader's one pattern is stones, so the hatch is the variation colour in soft patches. Lengths are in metres over the level (250 times life size).
